Some people eat sharks in a variety of manners.

00:49:18.830 --> 00:49:22.040
Some people use their skin for purses, boots, or belts.

00:49:22.930 --> 00:49:25.070
Sharks' teeth are often used for jewelry,

00:49:25.210 --> 00:49:27.950
and shark oil is used to manufacture skin creams,

00:49:28.150 --> 00:49:29.390
lipsticks, and pills.

00:49:30.092 --> 00:49:34.672
Something's fishy going on here those sharks don't deserve their mean reputation

00:49:35.084 --> 00:49:38.684
Humanoids do more harm to sharks than sharks have ever done to humanoids.

00:49:39.116 --> 00:49:40.116
Poor church.

00:49:40.296 --> 00:49:40.896
Uh-oh, sir.

00:49:41.260 --> 00:49:42.720
Message coming in from Admiral Lump.

00:49:43.244 --> 00:49:44.244
Rayon!

00:49:44.428 --> 00:49:46.008
Do you have that report for me?

00:49:46.148 --> 00:49:48.588
Well, your great globular grandness,

00:49:48.708 --> 00:49:51.008
I may have been a little premature

00:49:51.008 --> 00:49:52.988
when I told you those sharks were.

00:49:53.292 --> 00:49:54.452
Vicious human killers.

00:49:55.116 --> 00:49:55.616
What?!

00:49:56.940 --> 00:49:58.700
I'll have your ski watch for this!

00:49:58.700 --> 00:49:59.980
Uh, no, now, they're-

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:04.340
There really are such things as sharks, and they can be quite ferocious too.

00:50:04.620 --> 00:50:07.600
But it turns out they only kill a few humans.

00:50:07.780 --> 00:50:12.020
In fact, for most sharks, humans are not on the menu.

00:50:12.460 --> 00:50:14.970
So I think we can report that...

00:50:15.000 --> 00:50:17.020
that it's safe to go back in the water.

00:50:17.540 --> 00:50:21.720
Leon, from now on, you better get it right the first time.

00:50:22.030 --> 00:50:22.730
Lump out.

00:50:23.050 --> 00:50:28.510
Yes, Admiral Rump, Lump, Squeege, take us out of here.

00:50:30.480 --> 00:50:37.380
I guess you're going to have to hit it.

00:50:40.380 --> 00:50:41.160
That's it, Fred.

00:50:42.060 --> 00:50:43.240
All ahead, fall.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:59.980
Thank you.
